STEP 3 -- routed path and state (19:09; 11346-s3-*)
  45 s at 1000 pps (45,001 sent). Two frames captured verbosely at eth2:
    84:e3:27:87:07:80 > 01:00:5e:71:01:01 ... (tos 0x0, ttl 14, ...) 10.113.1.2.5000 > 239.113.1.1.5001
