     vlan3113 MAC (`show interface vlan3113`, 2026-10-01 08:02, 11346-r0-u3.out).
  stack 19:09:08  (10.113.1.2, 239.113.1.1) "Source directly connected on vlan3111",
                  "State-Refresh Originator State: Originator", Upstream Forwarding,
                  Downstream IF List: vlan3112 in 'olist'. show ip mroute: Owner PIM-DM,
                  Flags: TF, Incoming vlan3111, Outgoing vlan3112 (1).
  SA 19:09:17     RPF Neighbor 10.113.2.1 vlan3112, Upstream Forwarding, Downstream vlan3113 in
                  'olist'. show ip mroute: Owner PIM-DM, Flags: F, Incoming vlan3112,
