OBSERVATIONS (not graded)
  O-1 SA 19:10:25, one second after the re-join: `show ip pim dense-mode mroute` shows the
      upstream (vlan3112) "Assert State: Loser". With two routers and no second path on that
      VLAN no assert was expected. Seen once; no packet capture of PIM on the link.
  O-2 After `no ip pim dense-mode` on every SVI (2026-10-01 restore) `show ip pim dense-mode
      interface` reads "Total configured interfaces: -1   Maximum allowed: 100" on BOTH the
      stack and the SA: a negative count (display defect).
  O-3 `no service pdm` answers "% Save the config and restart for this change to take
      effect."; `pdmd` stays in `show process` (3 on the stack, 1 on the SA) until a reboot.
      This is the documented service-gated behaviour, as for pim6/ospf6 (orient-dt §2).

